      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just so people know, the issue was not related to the sibling object checks. It was actually calling AudioSettings.Reset(config) every time the window is clicked and for some reason this freezes unity for a few seconds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
